&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with storage-intensive applications and their requirements such as structured databases (SQL, Oracle) is highly desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
