&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3394 - Director, Business Intelligence - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is within Mindshare, a leading brand within WPP Media, where you will be responsible for the strategy, development, and operations of Estée Lauder’s data infrastructure and visualisation ecosystem. This role oversees the end-to-end data flow — from ingestion and transformation within GCP to delivery through Power BI dashboards — ensuring scalable, consistent, and high-quality data solutions across markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will establish global standards, drive operational excellence, and partner with regional teams and clients to enable data-driven decisioning. Supported by a mix of FTE and project-based resources, this position is accountable for building and governing both the data operations framework and dashboarding capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Operations (GCP, Adverity, Data Pipelines)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the roll-out and on-going maintenance of a custom instance of WPP’s Measure “Campaign Performance” platform, which leverages Adverity, SQL via DBT, Microsoft PowerBI, and Google Cloud Platform (GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Client Analytics team to deliver on Learning Agenda and Measurement Plan priorities in both raw and visualized data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a roadmap and backlog of features in support of ELC’s evolving BI needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with local market stakeholders to support or lead the development of key-market-specific features[&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage the global GCP environment, including data ingestion, transformation, and governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee integration of data sources via Adverity and other pipelines, ensuring reliability and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement business rules for data harmonisation and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Campaign Performance Product/Enablement and Custom Measure Consulting teams on platform evolution and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain operational processes, documentation, and quality controls across data workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Visualisation (Power BI / Dashboarding)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take an expansive view of business intelligence and data visualisation, delivering best-in-class dashboards and data exploration tools for media reporting, media plan visualisation, investment, and operations reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the global dashboarding ecosystem, including data flow from GCP to Power BI solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and govern filtering logic, metric definitions, and visualisation standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the roadmap for dashboard enhancements, scalability, and performance optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure consistency across global dashboards while enabling regional customisation where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Sharing &amp;amp; Client Partnership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with client teams to enable and manage GCP-to-GCP data sharing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact for data infrastructure and visualisation across stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and client requirements into scalable data and reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Governance &amp;amp; Regional Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global standards for data models, business rules (including taxonomy applicability and adherence), and dashboarding frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with regional teams on requirements, localisation needs, and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance global consistency with flexibility for market-specific use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team &amp;amp; Delivery Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a hybrid team of FTE and project-based engineering, business intelligence/visualization, and governance resources to deliver against roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set priorities, manage delivery, and ensure alignment across multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement in processes, tools, and operating model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently,&amp;nbsp;we do allow a hybrid work schedule but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to step into a senior leadership position at the heart of Verifone’s global payments ecosystem. You will shape operational risk management across four regulated payment entities, influence the future of our payments &amp;amp; financial services strategy, and drive automation and continuous improvement at scale. For an experienced operational risk leader, this role offers the chance to modernise first‑line operations, strengthen controls, and contribute directly to how a renowned, established company continues to grow its presence in the UK/EU market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Whilst our preferred office location for you to be close to is Munich, we are open to considering candidates located near to our Bad Hersfeld, Helsinki, and Bucharest office too.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all first line activities across the four Verifone payment entities, covering the teams responsible for onboarding, re-underwriting, fraud and AML transaction monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first contact point for all 1st line questions and escalations across the four entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a consistent first line operating model, standards and performance expectations while respecting entity-specific regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own first line KPIs, SLAs and quality metrics, ensuring case volumes and backlogs are managed within risk appetite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and remediate gaps across the onboarding, re-underwriting, fraud and AML transaction monitoring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the first line control environment and ensure controls are effective, evidenced and audit-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve higher-risk onboarding cases and escalation decisions, including complex ownership and foreign-owned structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary focus is on: Merchant onboarding, KYC, CDD and KYB, Periodic, trigger-based and event-driven re-underwriting and risk reviews, Fraud monitoring and case management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AML transaction monitoring, sanctions and transaction screening, and alert handling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and deliver the automation roadmap to reduce manual effort, improve accuracy and scale operations across entities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of automated onboarding/KYC, risk scoring, alert triage and transaction monitoring tuning to reduce false positives and shorten cycle times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the onboarding process offers the best possible client experience while applying regulatory requirements proportionately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop a people strategy that allows execution upon the vision – across functions and locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product teams to ship and deliver best-in-market KYC product experiences to our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilise data and user research to optimise the onboarding experience and transform how we fight financial crime and fulfil regulatory obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimise third-party services and outsourced vendors (1st line related) across the operating model&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide management information and reporting to the EMEA CFO, senior leadership and risk committees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with second line (Compliance/Risk), internal audit, partner banks and technology to close findings and embed sustainable fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop and scale multi-team, potentially multi-jurisdiction operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Skills and Experience We Desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in payments/fintech operations, risk or financial crime, with substantial time in first line leadership roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on knowledge of merchant onboarding/KYC, CDD, KYB, re-underwriting, fraud monitoring and AML transaction monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of corporate structures, UBO analysis and foreign ownership models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of identifying and mitigating gaps across these processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience automating onboarding, monitoring and case management processes with measurable efficiency gains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with regulated (payment) services &amp;amp; acquiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with KYC/AML systems, TM tools, sanctions/watchlist databases and adverse media platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the applicable EU regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client contact and managing client relationship processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize and meet deadlines without sacrificing quality of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and collaboratively, depending on the situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively present information to regulators and/or Verifone Group Senior Leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership experience, managing managers and large operational teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer (Backend; Wholesale)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In short&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On’s Wholesale business operates at a significant global scale. In 2025, it generated CHF 1.75 billion in net sales, representing 58.2% of On’s total revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wholesale technology teams build and evolve the systems that support On’s B2B business, including commerce, sell-in, merchandising and sales-enablement capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Backend Engineer who wants to understand the problems we are solving, not just implement requirements. You will work closely with engineers, Product and business stakeholders to build reliable systems, shape solutions and continuously improve how we deliver software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the right solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer and business problems behind the work, and help shape solutions and delivery plans based on user value, data and technical context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead solution design for complex problems, breaking them down into manageable pieces and driving consequential technical decisions within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, customer insights and technical context to challenge assumptions and help make good product and engineering decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with frontend, mobile and Product to deliver end-to-end outcomes rather than isolated backend components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own what you build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build and operate reliable and scalable backend services using Node.js, TypeScript, NestJS, Postgres, REST APIs, GraphQL, and streaming platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership from design through rollout and production, including testing, monitoring, operational risks and resolving issues when they occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pragmatic technical decisions with the team, balancing user value, delivery speed, quality and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify problems, dependencies and risks, and work to unblock yourself and the team rather than waiting for direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how we engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the team&#39;s systems and ways of working by removing recurring friction, unnecessary complexity and manual work, and improving developer productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the team&#39;s engineering standards through design discussions, code reviews, mentoring and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with distributed systems and cloud-native infrastructure on GCP, Kubernetes and Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructively challenge existing solutions and ways of working when you see a better approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI as part of engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development as a normal part of your workflow where it improves speed, quality or understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experiment with new tools and approaches, share what works, and help the team develop effective practices around AI-assisted engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong backend engineering experience and have designed, built and operated complex production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient with Node.js, NestJS, TypeScript, Postgres or other relational DB, REST APIs, GraphQL and streaming platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience with relational databases, data modelling and APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand distributed systems and have experience with cloud and containerised environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a product mindset and care about why something should be built, not only how to build it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You show strong ownership and autonomy, create clarity when things are ambiguous, and make progress without waiting for detailed instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You form your own point of view, challenge decisions constructively, and commit once a direction is agreed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You improve the systems, tools and ways of working around you, not just the features you are currently delivering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have practical experience with AI-assisted software development and actively look for better ways to use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven systems such as Kafka, Pub/Sub or BullMQ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MikroORM or similar ORM tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with e-commerce or B2B platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
